      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna are delighted to present this impressive four-bedroom A rated detached home, ideally situated in the highly sought-after Townparks area of Skerries.\n\nThe property offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout and benefits from an excellent A3 energy rating. Internally, the property comprises four generously sized bedrooms and three bathrooms, providing excellent space and convenience throughout the home.\n\nAt the heart of the property is a large kitchen and dining area. The spacious living room provides a comfortable and welcoming reception space with excellent proportions and plenty of natural light.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large private garden, providing an excellent outdoor space. The detached nature of the property also offers a high degree of privacy.\n\nA particularly attractive feature of the home is the sea views enjoyed from the bedrooms, adding to the appeal of this wonderful coastal property.\n\nLocated in the popular Townparks area, the property is within easy reach of Skerries town centre, local beaches, schools, shops, restaurants and a range of amenities."
      },
